{"id":781,"gn":"Pokémon Varech","ft":["Avec un bon coup d’ancre bien senti, il peut même assommer un Wailord. Son véritable corps est la partie composée de limon.","C’est une réincarnation de l’âme des algues. Son corps est formé de détritus marins qu’il enveloppe de limon.","Il enserre ses victimes de ses algues vertes pour aspirer leur énergie vitale. Il ne chasse que les grosses proies, comme les Wailord.","Les algues vertes formant sa chaîne s’étendent sur plusieurs centaines de mètres. Il s’entend bien avec Venalgue.","Ce Pokémon Spectre naît lorsque les algues dérivant au fond de l’océan se fixent sur des morceaux d’épaves de navire.","Il tend des guets-apens à ses proies en larguant son ancre dans la mer. Il peut absorber l’énergie vitale de grosses proies comme Wailord."],"fv":{"27":0,"28":1,"29":2,"30":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":-1,"cr":25,"hc":25,"bh":70,"eg":["Minéral"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"swcrown":[0,162],"sw":[0,360],"usum":[0,344],"usum*":[3,91],"sm":[0,263],"sm*":[3,78]},"f":{"781":{"n":"Sinistrail","t":["ghost","grass"],"s":[70,131,100,86,90,40],"h":3.9,"w":210,"a":[[200,0]],"av":["swcrown","sw","usum","sm"],"ls":[{"l":[[71,1],[229,1],[310,4],[35,8],[72,12],[74,16],[360,20],[415,24],[202,28],[250,32],[484,36],[21,40],[247,44],[319,48],[677,52],[412,56],[566,60],[438,64]],"m":[14,56,57,63,76,89,156,157,164,168,173,182,202,203,214,240,241,247,250,263,270,280,330,334,360,362,371,372,412,416,421,430,438,442,447,482,484,496,502,506,523,566,669,693,710,776],"t":[798,803,809]},{"l":[[415,1],[71,1],[74,1],[229,1],[310,1],[72,5],[35,9],[360,14],[319,18],[202,23],[250,27],[677,32],[247,36],[412,41],[21,45],[484,50],[566,54],[438,59]],"m":[14,57,63,76,89,92,104,156,157,164,168,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,247,263,280,332,360,371,373,412,416,421,430,447,482,496,523,590,693],"t":[173,180,202,220,235,270,272,282,334,335,442,477,502]},{"l":[[415,1],[71,1],[74,1],[229,1],[310,1],[72,5],[35,9],[360,14],[319,18],[202,23],[250,27],[677,32],[247,36],[412,41],[21,45],